    "description": "<p>During a conflict, you may use an action to perform a <strong>free attack</strong> with a <strong>weapon</strong> you have equipped, treating your <strong>High Roll</strong> as 0 when calculating damage. After the attack is resolved, choose one option:</p><ul><li><p>One ally that is able to hear you recovers <strong>【5 + (SL × 5)】</strong> Hit Points.</p></li><li><p>You may immediately use a Skill you acquired among <strong>Bishop's Edict</strong>, <strong>Charging Cavalry</strong> or <strong>King's Castle</strong> for free (spending the appropriate MP).</p></li></ul>",
